      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im training for my first marathon and the muscle soreness is just unreal right now. like i can barely walk down stairs. i have some tylenol at home but i dont want to take too little and not feel anything so i can actually sleep. whats the most i can safely take in a day to really knock this out so i can recover?",
