      "content": "thanks for that. but i feel like 3000mg is kinda low for someone as active as i am... like i'm burning through everything. i've heard people say you can go up to 4000 or even more if you really need to get past the pain. is it actually dangerous if i hit that 4000mg mark just for tonight to make sure i can actually get some rest?",
